  {
   "id": "paper-dolls-2-156935@post-2020-07-09",
   "gameId": "paper-dolls-2-156935",
   "displayName": "问题修复报告",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2020-07-09T10:32:54.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "嗨~小伙伴们~我又来啦~",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "问题修复报告",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "1. 修复了夫人boss战中，将夫人打虚弱后会瞬间站起来的问题",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. 修复开始播动画暂停后出现的问题",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. 修复了进柜子后会穿墙的问题",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. 修复了七星阵老爷boss战剧情触发的问题",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "5. 修复了封印夫人影分身两个灵魂卡死的问题",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "6. 修复了由于电脑卡顿产生的祠堂门未全开启的问题",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "7. 其他的部分问题修复",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "再次感谢大家的支持与理解~",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "如果游戏遇到问题，小伙伴们可以到我们开设的情报收集站：https://tieba.baidu.com/p/6794288858",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "提供情报，最好附带图片和视频，方便我们查出问题所在，万分感激：）",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "欢迎加入官方QQ群：170580619",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
